# TEMP: keep the curated skill/ tree out of the image so /app/skill stays empty
# and no deployment skills are loaded at startup. Deployment skills can't yet be
# pinned to an agent's allowlist (upstream bug: the agent write path prunes skill
# ids with no backing Mongo doc), so the curated set is delivered as UI-imported
# DB skills instead. Remove this line to bake the deployment skills back in once 
# a PR fixes the bug.
/skill

# Ignore all hidden files
.*
